{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Bloodgrounds_Steam_Banner_Logo.png?t=1749232767\" /><br>Lead your team of Gladiators in turn-based arena battles, recruiting, training, and sometimes sacrificing them for glory. But remember, your Gladiators are mortal - If they fall in battle, they are lost forever... though their legacy will live on.<br><br>As a noble heir, you'll manage your city by unlocking, constructing, and upgrading buildings that provide new services and mechanics to aid you on your bloody quest for vengeance.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Bloodgrounds_Steam_Banner_DemoContent.png?t=1749232767\" /><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Experience the first <strong>2,5 - 4 hours</strong> of Bloodgrounds<br></li><li> Access the <strong>entire first Age</strong><br></li><li> Master the first arena and get an <strong>initial peek</strong> of what awaits you in the <strong>second Age</strong><br></li><li> <strong>6 out of 9 gladiator classes</strong> are available <br></li><li> Unlock up to <strong>4 out of 7 abilities per class</strong><br></li><li> <strong>Max. level</strong> of the gladiators: <strong>5 out of 15</strong> in the full game<br></li><li><strong> 7 out of 13 base buildings</strong> and their <strong>first out of 4 upgrades </strong><br></li><li> Collect a varity of <strong>common, rare and epic items</strong> (<strong>legendary items</strong> will be available in the full game)<br></li><li> <strong>20 out of 100 Achievements</strong></li></ul><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Bloodgrounds_Steam_Banner_Story.png?t=1749232767\" /><br>You fought tooth and nail for survival, driven by a burning hatred and a thirst for justice. Now, as a wealthy patron and a gladiator trainer, you plot your revenge against the tyrannical Emperor who stole your freedom and murdered your father. But the path to redemption is fraught with peril, and you must navigate a treacherous world filled with deception and danger.<br><br>Recruit new allies and expand your gladiator team to climb the ranks of the brutal tournaments. Each victory brings you closer to the grand Capitol, where your ultimate target - the Emperor, lost in his madness - awaits on his throne.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Animated_Mercy.gif?t=1749232767\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Bloodgrounds_Steam_Banner_BattlePreparation.png?t=1749232767\" /><br>Before each battle, assemble a team of gladiators from various classes: physical, ranged, or magical. Will you pay gold, duel them, or show mercy in the arena to recruit them?<br><br>Level them up, increase their stats, and learn new abilities to ensure they're battle-ready. Don't forget to address any negative statuses or traumas, and equip them with shiny new weapons, armor, and consumables.<br><br>Use powerful Deity abilities to aid your Gladiators in battle, or make a shady deal with a local crime lord to sabotage your enemies before the battle even begins.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Animated_Equipment.gif?t=1749232767\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Bloodgrounds_Steam_Banner_ArenaBattles.png?t=1749232767\" /><br>Combat unfolds in turn-based battles on a grid, where units act in order of initiative. Strategically move your gladiators, attack, and position them to outsmart and outmaneuver your opponents.<br><br>Use your action points wisely - unleash powerful weapon or class abilities, make use of items like potions and magical scrolls, or set traps on the ground to catch enemies off guard.<br><br>Win the favor of the audience by fulfilling their bloodthirsty wishes and reap rewards after each battle. But beware - permadeath is on. If a gladiator falls, they and their equipment are lost forever, adding high stakes to every decision.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Animated_Equipment.gif?t=1749232767\" /><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/BG_Main_Management.png?t=1749232767\" /><br>You\u2019ve inherited an estate overlooking the desolate coastal city of Marevento, and the city\u2019s future now rests in your hands.<br><br>Between battles, use your hard-earned gold to build and upgrade city buildings, unlocking new tools and services to aid you in your quest for vengeance.\u00a0From the infirmary, where your gladiators can recover, to the bustling market for trading items, and even a grand monument to honor fallen gladiators.<br><br>Defeat each region\u2019s Arena Champion to advance the age and access powerful new buildings and items.<br><br>Are you ready to rise to the challenge and carve your name into history?<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/extras/Animated_City.gif?t=1749232767\" />","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Arachnophobia","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/091f9fe56a235e5b02fcd816832965434a51214f.jpg"},{"name":"Cyclops Killer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/b0b2964ab8dfa6817ac7aa6338a59c972925eab7.jpg"},{"name":"Stonemason","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/ab6a67cc46ca91286d5edec64cdb89ebe36f535e.jpg"},{"name":"Gold is for Spending","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/2c9061582251ad0cd00290fa03599abff1820e81.jpg"},{"name":"Age of Sustain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/d13507fac005ac8db40f517d44683112ddc1da29.jpg"},{"name":"Pardon Me?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/68dae9bb60b586660f51169eae515950d2b1d7ac.jpg"},{"name":"Stone Cold","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/4cf9b20c3a536b92d8b3a5f0a6b959aab6ea0694.jpg"},{"name":"Seven Serendipities","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/e1bf3bb719ca8cc7e847a80f48374a3258559efa.jpg"},{"name":"Morituri Te Salutant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/60776097caf75b2f4fba65c17b4a75d73d62bb2f.jpg"},{"name":"Hospice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3729720/1e84a39c3dd24775f750c7a3eb5be5c1856326d8.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729720?t=1749232767","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3729720?t=1749232767","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/07171ce2e27a7c1f9eed989889fa5acb30fc2ebf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749232767","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3729720/07171ce2e27a7c1f9eed989889fa5acb30fc2ebf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749232767","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"As Bloodgrounds is based around Gladiator fights, players can expect scenes of violence and death during the battles."},"detailed_descript